  10+ 3C74              ; the entry pointer. The module returns with RET. The resident trampoline
  11+ 3C74              ; restores the previous selector before returning to the original caller.
  12+ 3C74              ; Each nesting level stores its previous selector on the WIN1 stack.
  13+ 3C74              ;
  14+ 3C74              ; The request selector, entry and caller HL are copied/restored before module entry, so
